<title>SINGAPORE: Shell Singapore 35,000-bpd cracker down to Dec 7.</title>
<headline>Shell Singapore 35,000-bpd cracker down to Dec 7.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Singapore shutdown on Friday a 35,000-barrels-per-day (bpd) cracker for a five-week scheduled maintenance, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;The cracker will be closed from November 1 to December 7,&quot; the spokeswoman said, confirming a Sept 27 Reuters report.</p>
<p>The long residue catalytic cracker converts low sulphur residues into gasoline and middle distillates.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3093)</p>
